      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Located at the confluence of the Clark Fork, Bitterroot, and Blackfoot rivers, Missoula is a fly‑fishing hotspot thanks to Norman Maclean’s novel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
