      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fort Missoula houses the Historic Museum, the Rocky Mountain Museum of Military History, and the Northern Rockies Heritage Center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Missoula%2C_Montana",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Roxy Theater and Wilma Theater in downtown Missoula host the International Wildlife Film Festival and the Big Sky Documentary Film Festival, respectively.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
